{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> are perpendicular diameters of circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e983d56ebe3fca75a19b5453844c4a059a50d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle QPC = 60^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />, then the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab17967324fc2b12349c0610c6c256f4c829162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> divided by the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/6/7563031eab26ad18658cf2f6a8e4948861bb9013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/6/af6536e9aad37d9adc89488534475826e565cbcb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(150); defaultpen(linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10)); pair A=(-1,0), B=(1,0), C=(0,1), D=(0,-1), Q=origin, P=(-0.5,0); draw(P--C--D^^A--B^^Circle(Q,1)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, E); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, N); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, S); label(&quot;$P$&quot;, P, S); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;, Q, SE); label(&quot;$60^\\circ$&quot;, P+0.05*dir(30), dir(30));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"248\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6abd89fc7477b0d8e541ff50f5bdca844b640c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ \\frac12 \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ \\frac23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"394\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c8aeef7b21a4b259c6947cc518096119fb80c14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle PCQ=30^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />, and therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/2/ee290676fdfdb49f5a062edb88d2e0b8ddfd6fa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PCQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" /> is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/f/80f57a6496573d4a5870a2d40a90c06735171aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^\\circ-60^\\circ-90^\\circ$\" width=\"120\" height=\"13\" /> right triangle. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/1990647b39c7d74657e0085fa904f05c19e9e1ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = PQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd664ebcd45874a6e7dc837dd954b7320bbc6240.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CQ=AQ=x\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"140\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/9/f799513800e219047476a1b77455a7fac11af58c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PQ}{AQ}=\\frac{x}{x\\sqrt{3}}=\\boxed{(\\textbf{B})\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"194\" height=\"54\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\